# 1Password JavaScript SDK v0.5.0

## NEW


1Password JavaScript SDK v0.5.1-beta.1
FIXED
Secret references with a vault's account-type name: Secret references that name a Personal vault by its account-type name now resolve. For example, op://Employee/... on a Team or Business account, as copied with "Copy Secret Reference" in the 1Password app. Before, they failed with "no vault matched the secret reference query".
IMPROVED
Support link in error messages: Internal error messages now link to https://www.1password.dev/joinslack.- **Workload Identity authentication (public preview):** The SDK can now authenticate using workload identity via 1Password Credential Broker. Provide an `oidcFetcher` and `workloadDetails` to `createClient()` instead of a service account token. Currently available for GitHub Actions only.
